{"3769800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elevator", "steam_appid": 3769800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through The Elevator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a simple trip to the top. Each stop will open your eyes to the mysteries of the Elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What floor will you stop on? Will you escape? The Elevator decides your fate now!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the makers of Elevator: Source comes Elevator, the sequel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Teaser</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teaser demo is about 30-50 minutes of gameplay and shows the potential of Elevator. This demo represents the idea of what Elevator is going to be about, and before we got funding on Kickstarter. This teaser is best played with friends. <strong>The demo is playable online with up to 8 Steam friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dbe0721eaeb2ebbb5c2d22522e80abe9.poster.avif?t=1784318465\" width=680 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dbe0721eaeb2ebbb5c2d22522e80abe9.webm?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dbe0721eaeb2ebbb5c2d22522e80abe9.mp4?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevator is a an absurdist, comedy-horror multiplayer game about centered around traveling in an Elevator that takes you across dimensions and time. Combining both comedy and horror elements, with explorable floors. Every time you play, you’re in for a different ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/50381e208cbdb586cf12d0ada7206e6c.poster.avif?t=1784318465\" width=680 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/50381e208cbdb586cf12d0ada7206e6c.webm?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/50381e208cbdb586cf12d0ada7206e6c.mp4?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op up to 8 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable mementos from each floor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dd3d2c162335ebbb3fa94e6dd7db46db.poster.avif?t=1784318465\" width=680 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dd3d2c162335ebbb3fa94e6dd7db46db.webm?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dd3d2c162335ebbb3fa94e6dd7db46db.mp4?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An unparalleled elevator experience where you can:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience cinematic elevator-based happenstances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange and possibly dangerous worlds the Elevator brings you to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait in an elevator, and check your watch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness oddities the Elevator shows you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks at the Elevator’s whims</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal and unlock mementos as proof of your experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the Elevator’s origins, history, and future</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cough on your friends in an elevator setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new and interesting NPCs that secretly dislike you</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/d3c33d01ab0e7263c7efbf901e75dcd7.poster.avif?t=1784318465\" width=680 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/d3c33d01ab0e7263c7efbf901e75dcd7.webm?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/d3c33d01ab0e7263c7efbf901e75dcd7.mp4?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support (with rumble)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice effects &amp; filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility options (key binding, FOV)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive floors &amp; exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latest Unreal 5.6 engine (Lumen disabled for performance)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NVidia DLSS support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've been wanting to make a standalone sequel to Elevator: Source for many years! After releasing our first game, Tower Unite, we've finally been able to return back to our roots and create a new and exciting chapter to Elevator: Source, one of our beloved mods that we originally made in GMod. Using Unreal Engine 5 and upgraded graphics and animations, we've hand-crafted a fun-filled multiplayer game designed to make you laugh, get shocked, and sometimes get a little frightened. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sequel to Elevator: Source</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been 13 years since Elevator: Source. In the original mod, floors were merely observed. This time, Elevator is going to take it to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sequel, you'll get to leave the Elevator to solve puzzles, complete strange tasks, conquer minigames, stay away from deadly monsters, and discover many easter eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through The Elevator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a simple trip to the top. Each stop will open your eyes to the mysteries of the Elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What floor will you stop on? Will you escape? The Elevator decides your fate now!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the makers of Elevator: Source comes Elevator, the sequel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Teaser</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teaser demo is about 30-50 minutes of gameplay and shows the potential of Elevator. This demo represents the idea of what Elevator is going to be about, and before we got funding on Kickstarter. This teaser is best played with friends. <strong>The demo is playable online with up to 8 Steam friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dbe0721eaeb2ebbb5c2d22522e80abe9.poster.avif?t=1784318465\" width=680 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dbe0721eaeb2ebbb5c2d22522e80abe9.webm?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/dbe0721eaeb2ebbb5c2d22522e80abe9.mp4?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevator is a an absurdist, comedy-horror multiplayer game about centered around traveling in an Elevator that takes you across dimensions and time. Combining both comedy and horror elements, with explorable floors. Every time you play, you’re in for a different ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/50381e208cbdb586cf12d0ada7206e6c.poster.avif?t=1784318465\" width=680 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/50381e208cbdb586cf12d0ada7206e6c.webm?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/extras/50381e208cbdb586cf12d0ada7206e6c.mp4?t=1784318465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op up to 8 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer</p></li><li><p 