et to leave the Elevator to solve puzzles, complete strange tasks, conquer minigames, stay away from deadly monsters, and discover many easter eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Embark on a journey through The Elevator. This is not a simple trip to the top. Each stop will open your eyes to the mysteries of the Elevator. What floor will it stop on? What will it show? The Elevator decides your fate now!!! From the makers of Elevator: Source comes Elevator, the sequel.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/f0188e8647cc15cc1f508c7be8dc69f6dcd5582c/header.jpg?t=1784318465", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/5908958291af9f6bf21c2c71cb861c043a55fc47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784318465", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769800/5908958291af9f6bf21c2c71cb861c043a55fc47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784318465", "website": "https://playelevator.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core Intel or AMD, 2.4 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10 Compatible GPU with 4 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR, OpenXR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Integrated graphic cards will have trouble running the game.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operat